00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.470
- I love you!

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:25.370
You're pulling it off!

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:26.307
- It's kind of cute, right?

00:00:26.307 --> 00:00:27.500
- I love it, the horses.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.333
I love it.

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:29.760
Hey, you go on the road quite a bit.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.420
Do you ever visit any national parks?

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:32.253
- You know what?

00:00:32.253 --> 00:00:34.530
I don't, because I don't exercise,

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.363
- Yeah.

00:00:35.363 --> 00:00:36.196
- [Whitney] 'Cause I hurt myself.

00:00:36.196 --> 00:00:38.793
I rolled my ankle at the
Rock and Roll Hall of Fame

00:00:38.793 --> 00:00:39.626
(audience chuckles)

00:00:39.626 --> 00:00:40.907
and everyone was like, "You're not allowed

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.361
