00:00:42.361 --> 00:00:44.742
My health insurance is
just not good enough!

00:00:44.742 --> 00:00:45.575
(audience chuckles)

00:00:45.575 --> 00:00:47.513
- So do you like being on the road?

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:48.840
- [Whitney] I love touring!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.883
I love, love, love touring,
but I'm terrible at logistics.

00:00:51.883 --> 00:00:52.716
- Oh!

00:00:52.716 --> 00:00:53.549
- I'm bad at math.

00:00:53.549 --> 00:00:54.500
Like, we're artists, and we're expected--

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.830
- Do you need to be good at math?

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.680
- Well, I have to sometimes
post on social media

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:01.280
where I'm going and I mess up the dates.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.930
Like, I'm going to Miami, right?

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:04.567
And I'm posting 22 cities and I'm like,

00:01:04.567 --> 00:01:05.567
"I can't wait to come to Miami!"

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:06.442
"I can't wait to come to Miami!"

00:01:06.442 --> 00:01:07.275
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:08.108
- Everyone's like, "We
can't find the tickets."

00:01:08.108 --> 00:01:09.340
I'm like, "I don't know what's going on!"

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.820
I find out I'm going to Miami, Oklahoma!

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:14.361
(audience groans incredulously)

00:01:14.361 --> 00:01:15.203
(audience laughs)

00:01:15.203 --> 00:01:16.036
- There's a Miami, Oklahoma?

00:01:16.036 --> 00:01:17.947
- [Whitney] First of all,
it's pronounced, "Miam-uh".

00:01:17.947 --> 00:01:18.780
(laughing)

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.430
It's not Miami, it's "Miam-uh"!

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.270
National Parks Guy, do you
know what I'm talking about?

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:23.310
- National Parks Guy!

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.210
(audience laughs)

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.590
- [Whitney] Do you know what I mean?

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:27.641
(audience claps)

00:01:27.641 --> 00:01:29.867
It's called Miami,
Oklahoma, and I was like,

00:01:29.867 --> 00:01:31.460
"Okay, I'm going to Miami, right?"

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:33.977
But, in the email they
kept writing Miami, OK.

00:01:35.202 --> 00:01:36.040
OK!

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:36.873
- Oh like, "Okay?"

00:01:36.873 --> 00:01:38.866
- [Whitney] And I'm like, "Okay, book it!"

00:01:38.866 --> 00:01:39.699
(audience laughs)

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:40.532
- Yeah!

00:01:40.532 --> 00:01:41.720
- And then it's, "OK is Oklahoma."

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:42.553
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:42.553 --> 00:01:44.700
- [Whitney] Yeah, so I
just can't be trusted

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:45.634
to do my own--

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:46.467
- You can't be trusted?"

00:01:46.467 --> 00:01:47.300
- Schedule!

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:51.570
But, I am gonna go to Miami,
Florida at some point.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:52.403
I love go--

00:01:52.403 --> 00:01:53.300
You've performed in Miami.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.133
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:54.966
- I mean, it's the best!

00:01:54.966 --> 00:01:55.799
They party!

00:01:55.799 --> 00:01:56.632
- They're a fun audience!

00:01:56.632 --> 00:01:57.465
- They party and--

00:01:57.465 --> 00:01:58.298
- Like it doesn't matter
how much you suck,

00:01:58.298 --> 00:01:59.276
they're still drunk and just
having such a good time.

00:01:59.276 --> 00:02:00.109
- [Whitney] Yeah, such a good time!

00:02:00.109 --> 00:02:01.505
Well, they don't need you to be there!

00:02:01.505 --> 00:02:02.338
(audience laughs and cheer)

00:02:02.338 --> 00:02:06.330
So Miami, a lot of time people
wanna come and film shows now

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.920
and with stand-up, it's a little tricky

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.577
'cause you're like, "I don't
want this to go on YouTube

00:02:09.577 --> 00:02:10.900
"before I shoot a special."

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.760
And there were these girls
that were filming during

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.810
the show and I didn't
want them to post it,

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:15.643
and someone to take it
down, so I was like,

00:02:15.643 --> 00:02:16.557
"You know what, girls?

00:02:16.557 --> 00:02:17.727
"Can you maybe stop filming,

00:02:17.727 --> 00:02:19.330
"we can take pictures
together at the end?"

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:20.163
And they looked at me going,

00:02:20.163 --> 00:02:21.187
"Oh, we're not...

00:02:21.187 --> 00:02:22.020
"We're not filming you.

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:23.676
"We're filming ourselves."

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.170
(audience laughs)

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:27.200
- [Kelly] Well thanks
for paying attention!

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.777
That drives me nuts sometimes!

00:02:28.777 --> 00:02:30.480
And I don't care if people film wherever.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.900
But, it's just like,
can we just be present?

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:33.733
- [Whitney] No.

00:02:33.733 --> 00:02:34.566
- Like in the moment?

00:02:34.566 --> 00:02:35.399
- [Whitney] Need the proof.

00:02:35.399 --> 00:02:36.232
- Is it okay for you to put it down?

00:02:36.232 --> 00:02:37.065
(laughs)

00:02:37.065 --> 00:02:37.898
Nothing will happen!

00:02:37.898 --> 00:02:38.940
Well, I don't know, in this day and age,

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:40.076
politically, something might happen!

00:02:40.076 --> 00:02:41.036
(laughs)

00:02:41.036 --> 00:02:41.869
I don't know what'll happen.

00:02:41.869 --> 00:02:42.702
But it's just, I don't know.

00:02:42.702 --> 00:02:43.535
People are crazy.

00:02:43.535 --> 00:02:44.368
But what do people say to you, like fans?

00:02:44.368 --> 00:02:45.570
You groupies, you tour, so--

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:47.850
- I feel very lucky because I do stand-up,

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.150
I share a lot of my personal stuff,

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:52.710
I do podcasts, so a lot of
people know a lot about me.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:55.080
So, people feel very
comfortable coming up to me

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:58.540
in public and sharing intimate
details about themselves

00:02:58.540 --> 00:02:59.373
'cause I've done it.

00:02:59.373 --> 00:03:01.690
And people will just
come up to me at airports

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:03.777
and they'll be like, "I have two kids

00:03:03.777 --> 00:03:05.230
"and I like one better
than the other one!"

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:06.063
- [Kelly] Oh my--

00:03:06.063 --> 00:03:07.086
- And they'll just walk off!

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:07.919
(audience gasps)

00:03:07.919 --> 00:03:09.326
- "And I like one better
than the other one?"

00:03:09.326 --> 00:03:10.159
- [Whitney] Other one!

00:03:10.159 --> 00:03:11.010
I had one woman tell me--

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:12.860
- You don't say that!

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:13.750
Or think that!

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.420
- [Whitney] 'Cause I share
so much intimate stuff

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.550
about my life, I think people

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:17.876
feel like they should share it with me.

00:03:17.876 --> 00:03:20.840
One woman was like,
"Sometimes I hide in my car

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.516
down the street so I don't
have to see my kids!"

00:03:22.516 --> 00:03:23.840
(audience laughs)

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:24.673
- You know what?

00:03:24.673 --> 00:03:25.606
Okay, that one, I understand.

00:03:25.606 --> 00:03:26.439
(audience laughs)

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:27.272
That's what I do.

00:03:27.272 --> 00:03:28.105
No, just kidding!

00:03:28.105 --> 00:03:28.938
- She was like, "I pretend
I'm running errands

00:03:28.938 --> 00:03:30.216
"and I just hide in my car."

00:03:30.216 --> 00:03:31.348
I'm like, "That's kind of a like hack."

00:03:31.348 --> 00:03:32.181
- That's like, I'm like,

00:03:32.181 --> 00:03:33.014
"Oh, Mommy's gotta go to the bathroom."

00:03:33.014 --> 00:03:33.943
Like, 40 minutes later,

00:03:33.943 --> 00:03:34.880
(laughs)

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.280
I have not been in the bathroom!

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.345
- Just napping on the toilet!

00:03:37.345 --> 00:03:38.484
- I just wanted to lay down down!"

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:39.317
(audience claps)

00:03:39.317 --> 00:03:40.510
So I did not know this last
the time you were here.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.630
But I heard that you have
done an impression of me.

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:45.013
- I can't believe I'm
even telling you this!

00:03:45.013 --> 00:03:45.900
When I first moved to Los--

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:46.870
- I wanna hear it!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.193
- I don't wanna tell you this!

00:03:48.193 --> 00:03:50.570
Remember the show Mad TV?

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:51.403
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:03:51.403 --> 00:03:52.770
- When I first moved to Los Angeles,

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:56.320
I auditioned for Mad TV
and I don't do characters.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:57.580
I don't do impressions.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:00.750
But, I loved your music video
for Since You've Been Gone.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:01.583
- Me too!

00:04:01.583 --> 00:04:03.360
- Where you were just freaking
out for three minutes!

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.617
- I got to break things all
day and got paid for it!

00:04:05.617 --> 00:04:07.390
(laughs)

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.867
- And so I was like, "I'm just gonna do

00:04:08.867 --> 00:04:10.110
"an impression of Kelly Clarkson!"

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.620
and I went in the audition room

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:14.280
and I just started throwing stuff around,

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:17.394
and smashing stuff, and
screaming, and going nuts.

00:04:17.394 --> 00:04:18.914
And I did not get the job!

00:04:18.914 --> 00:04:21.140
(audience laughs)

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:21.973
- Shocking!

00:04:21.973 --> 00:04:23.048
Shocking!

00:04:23.048 --> 00:04:23.881
(laughing)

00:04:23.881 --> 00:04:24.714
I just took a bunch of Adderall

00:04:24.714 --> 00:04:25.575
and just went crazy basically.

00:04:25.575 --> 00:04:26.408
(laughs)

00:04:26.408 --> 00:04:27.520
And looking back now, you know when

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.783
you look back at things
you did in your early 20s?

00:04:29.783 --> 00:04:30.616
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:04:30.616 --> 00:04:32.306
- I can't believe they
didn't call the police.

00:04:32.306 --> 00:04:33.139
- [Kelly] Yeah.
(audience laughs)

00:04:33.139 --> 00:04:34.780
Are you any better at auditions now?

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:35.613
- [Whitney] No!

00:04:35.613 --> 00:04:36.456
No!

00:04:36.456 --> 00:04:37.289
(audience laughs)

00:04:37.289 --> 00:04:39.360
Not great at... I just
start getting sweaty.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.220
I get too anxious at auditions.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:42.053
- [Kelly] Oh!

00:04:42.053 --> 00:04:42.886
You're so great, though!

00:04:42.886 --> 00:04:43.719
- [Whitney] Thank you!

00:04:43.719 --> 00:04:44.552
- Okay, yeah.

00:04:44.552 --> 00:04:45.385
- I agree!

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:46.218
(audience laughs and cheers)

00:04:46.218 --> 00:04:48.027
- I agree, I'm amazing!

00:04:49.829 --> 00:04:52.830
So, when you go on the
road, do you take anything,

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.050
'cause I do, do you take
anything special on the road?

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:57.770
- When I'm on the road... I
am not a game, on the road!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:58.603
I pack.

00:04:58.603 --> 00:05:00.400
I bring my own microphone on the road.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.290
- Your own microphone?

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.490
- I bring a microphone
with me, so I'm not sharing

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.030
a microphone with 300 road comics.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:06.915
So, I'm not getting--

00:05:06.915 --> 00:05:07.794
- [Kelly] Oh, and them spitting--

00:05:07.794 --> 00:05:09.370
- Weird, nasty, you know.
- [Kelly] Yeah!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.650
I've never thought about that!

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:11.483
- You gotta bring your own mic!

00:05:11.483 --> 00:05:12.840
- Oh, I do that at radio shows

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:13.840
and all the artists get up there.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:14.673
I have to share a mic.

00:05:14.673 --> 00:05:15.557
That's disgusting!

00:05:15.557 --> 00:05:18.420
- [Whitney] Oh yeah,
there's old lipstick on it,

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.650
and just nasty chin beard pubes!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:21.840
- [Kelly] I have my people take care of me

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:22.869
and I don't have their mic.

00:05:22.869 --> 00:05:23.702
(laughs)

00:05:23.702 --> 00:05:24.535
Okay, that's gross.

00:05:24.535 --> 00:05:25.368
But, do you take anything else?

00:05:25.368 --> 00:05:26.201
- [Whitney] Well, you
do have to be careful

00:05:26.201 --> 00:05:28.160
in the airport when a
microphone goes through TSA,

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.350
(laughs)

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.429
a lot of times, they don't
know it's a microphone!

00:05:31.429 --> 00:05:34.480
(audience laughs and claps)

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:37.437
So, you really have to stop and be like,

00:05:37.437 --> 00:05:40.407
"This does not vibrate,
it's not battery op--

00:05:40.407 --> 00:05:42.690
"That is a microphone, I swear!"

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.869
- You're like, "But if it did vibrate..."

00:05:44.869 --> 00:05:45.702
(laughs)

00:05:45.702 --> 00:05:46.940
- [Whitney] Yeah, I mean look,
if they make that product,

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.153
I'm not gonna freak out!

00:05:49.186 --> 00:05:50.650
- Yeah, that's your problem!

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.069
- [Whitney] Call Shark Tank, by the way!

00:05:52.069 --> 00:05:53.790
(laughs and claps)

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.908
- Mark Cuban, listen!

00:05:54.908 --> 00:05:56.010
(laughs)

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:57.490
So, I hear you love Nashville.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:58.630
You love stopping in Nashville.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.190
- [Whitney] I'm obsessed with Nashville!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:01.829
I'm gonna be in Nashville on the tour.

00:06:01.829 --> 00:06:02.662
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:05.589
- I love going to Nashville
because of the vintage stores.

00:06:05.589 --> 00:06:06.422
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:06:06.422 --> 00:06:07.940
- They have the best vintage shopping.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.230
But I think I might stop doing it,

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:11.990
'cause last time I went, I
got this awesome denim jacket.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:14.030
It had all these patches on it and pins.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:15.450
And I wore it all the time on Instagram.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:18.840
I have a horse and I ride
my horse in this jacket.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:22.030
And I loved it so much,
and I got this DM one day,

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.257
from this guy who was like,

00:06:23.257 --> 00:06:26.537
"Hey, my ex got mad at me and sold

00:06:26.537 --> 00:06:29.210
"a bunch of my stuff to a vintage store."

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:31.820
(audience gasps)

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:32.858
I think you have--

00:06:32.858 --> 00:06:34.120
- First of all, that's awesome!

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:34.957
- I know!

00:06:34.957 --> 00:06:35.880
(audience laughs)

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:37.530
- How have I not thought of that?

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.030
That is amazing!

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:42.800
You're trashing your
stuff, plus making profit!

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:43.850
- Totally!

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:47.650
This woman is an entrepreneur
and she sounds awesome!

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.500
And so, he said, "Can I have it back?"

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.640
And I was like, "Yeah, I guess."

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:51.473
So I sent it back to him.

00:06:51.473 --> 00:06:53.706
- [Kelly] Did you tell him,
"For this amount of money,"?

00:06:53.706 --> 00:06:54.539
- I know!

00:06:54.539 --> 00:06:55.410
- I mean, I bought it!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:56.800
Sorry, she's a turd, but...

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.150
- [Whitney] I know!

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:00.510
So that, and then the other
thing about going to the South,

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:03.310
is I'm still trying to figure
out what everything means.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.450
And you could probably help me

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.090
with the Southern colloquialisms.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:06.923
- Yes.

00:07:06.923 --> 00:07:09.186
What does, "Bless your heart," mean?

00:07:09.186 --> 00:07:10.019
(audience chuckles)

00:07:10.019 --> 00:07:10.997
- Mm, mm.

00:07:10.997 --> 00:07:12.208
- Does it, it means you're stupid!

00:07:12.208 --> 00:07:13.041
(audience chuckles)

00:07:13.041 --> 00:07:17.030
- Well, there's like,
it depends on the tone.

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:17.863
- [Whitney] Yeah!

00:07:17.863 --> 00:07:18.696
- And who you're saying it to.

00:07:18.696 --> 00:07:19.910
- [Whitney] Okay, so
when I go to the South,

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.267
they'll ask me where
I'm from and I'm like,

00:07:21.267 --> 00:07:22.100
"I live in L.A."

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:22.933
And they're like,

00:07:22.933 --> 00:07:24.131
- Bless your heart.
- "Bless your heart."

00:07:24.131 --> 00:07:27.798
(audience laughs and claps)

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.595
- Or it's like--

00:07:30.595 --> 00:07:31.500
- [Whitney] What does that mean?

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.832
- It's... well it's not
a compliment sometimes.

00:07:33.832 --> 00:07:35.739
(laughing)

00:07:35.739 --> 00:07:39.281
It's a Southerner's way of being shady.

00:07:39.281 --> 00:07:40.114
- Yeah!

00:07:40.114 --> 00:07:41.130
(laughs)

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:42.523
- But doesn't it sound nice?

00:07:42.523 --> 00:07:45.010
It's like British people cursing you out.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:46.363
It sounds nice.
- That is so true!

00:07:46.363 --> 00:07:48.002
- It's like, you know
it's rude, but I like it.

00:07:48.002 --> 00:07:48.835
(audience laughs)

00:07:48.835 --> 00:07:49.668
- Yeah!

00:07:49.668 --> 00:07:50.640
- Yeah.

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.232
- And then I learned the
hard way that when a woman

00:07:53.232 --> 00:07:57.200
in the South says she's,
"Fixin' to pitch a fit,"

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.097
- I'm fixin' to pitch a fit, yes.

00:07:58.097 --> 00:07:59.110
- Get out of there!

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:00.188
- Yeah.

00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:01.021
Get out of there!

00:08:01.021 --> 00:08:02.430
Yup, and grab anything
that belongs to you,

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:03.523
'cause she'll sell it, too!

00:08:03.523 --> 00:08:06.900
(audience laughs and claps)

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:07.820
A Southern woman knows.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.310
She's smart.

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:13.622
- And then also, is tea sweet already?

00:08:13.622 --> 00:08:16.455
(audience laughs)

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.356
- No!

00:08:18.356 --> 00:08:21.677
- If you want tea that's
sweet, you just say,

00:08:21.677 --> 00:08:23.530
"I'd like some tea."

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.363
- [Kelly] Well,

00:08:24.363 --> 00:08:25.810
- But what if you don't want sweet tea?

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:26.643
- No, I've always been--

00:08:26.643 --> 00:08:27.740
- Bless my heart?

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:28.917
- Bless your heart!

00:08:28.917 --> 00:08:31.113
(audience laughs and claps)

00:08:31.113 --> 00:08:31.946
- [Kelly] You know what, though?

00:08:31.946 --> 00:08:32.779
I'm different.

00:08:32.779 --> 00:08:34.040
I don't really do sweet tea anymore.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:34.873
- [Whitney] Okay.

00:08:34.873 --> 00:08:36.030
- Yeah, I just fell in love with hot tea.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:36.863
- Okay,

00:08:36.863 --> 00:08:38.180
- All my Southern
friends just disowned me,

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:39.060
but I'm cool with that.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:39.893
- I was gonna say!

00:08:39.893 --> 00:08:40.726
(laughs)

00:08:40.726 --> 00:08:41.559
- It's fine.

00:08:41.559 --> 00:08:42.392
- She's gone full Hollywood!

00:08:42.392 --> 00:08:44.280
- Yes, exactly, I'm so L.A. with my tea.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:46.380
So, you have have thoughts
on Valentine's Day, I hear.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.213
- [Whitney] Well, yes.

00:08:47.213 --> 00:08:48.930
Valentine's Day is coming up very soon.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.388
And I feel like every
year guys screw it up!

00:08:51.388 --> 00:08:54.410
(audience laughs and cheers)

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.357
- Looking at you.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:58.270
- Not the park guy.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:08:59.110
Not the park guy.

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:00.950
So, I have some ideas for guys that

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:02.420
are watching the show
that want some advice.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.385
So, where am I looking?

00:09:04.385 --> 00:09:05.218
Oh, I'm gonna look into here.

00:09:05.218 --> 00:09:06.706
The guy up there, I'm looking at you, sir!

00:09:06.706 --> 00:09:08.055
(audience laughs)

00:09:08.055 --> 00:09:09.045
If you're buying a--

00:09:09.045 --> 00:09:09.878
(cymbal crashes)

00:09:09.878 --> 00:09:11.452
(audience laughs)

00:09:11.452 --> 00:09:15.119
(band plays romantic music)

00:09:16.854 --> 00:09:18.841
- [Kelly] No one warned you!

00:09:18.841 --> 00:09:20.694
No one warned you!

00:09:20.694 --> 00:09:23.795
All of a sudden my band just
really wanted to be a part.

00:09:23.795 --> 00:09:24.828
So they just started playing.

00:09:24.828 --> 00:09:25.881
- Oh my God!

00:09:25.881 --> 00:09:27.020
Oh God, okay!

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.830
- We are playing music under your PSA!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:30.670
- [Whitney] Oh Geez!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.503
(audience laughs)

00:09:31.503 --> 00:09:32.614
Okay, all right.

00:09:32.614 --> 00:09:33.447
Woo!

00:09:33.447 --> 00:09:34.280
I'm sweating!

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:35.163
Look, I'm sweating now, look!

00:09:35.163 --> 00:09:35.996
(audience laughs)

00:09:35.996 --> 00:09:36.829
- [Kelly] You are!

00:09:36.829 --> 00:09:38.700
Ah, you can't see, it's black!

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:40.230
- Okay, advice for the guys.

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.761
You ready, goatee in the back?

00:09:41.761 --> 00:09:42.594
You ready?

00:09:42.594 --> 00:09:44.020
(laughing)

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:44.853
All right.

00:09:44.853 --> 00:09:48.000
If you're buying ladies a
gift for Valentine's Day,

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.030
get a gift card!

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:50.920
I know, it's impersonal!

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.230
Get a gift card!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.451
I promise you,

00:09:53.451 --> 00:09:54.284
(audience cheers)

00:09:54.284 --> 00:09:55.267
I promise you.

00:09:57.161 --> 00:09:59.650
I promise you, it'll be less of a fight

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:02.293
than buying something in the wrong size.

00:10:02.293 --> 00:10:04.442
(audience applause)

00:10:04.442 --> 00:10:07.630
Also, if you're buying
something for your girlfriend

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:11.910
of two or more years, and
decide to buy her jewelry

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:15.870
that's not an engagement
ring, I suggest you give her

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.802
that jewelry box wearing a helmet!

00:10:17.802 --> 00:10:19.920
(audience laughs)

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:22.063
'Cause you're about to get concussed, sir.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.383
Godspeed!

00:10:25.383 --> 00:10:26.216
(audience cheers)

00:10:26.216 --> 00:10:27.049
- See?

00:10:27.049 --> 00:10:27.882
Thank you.

00:10:27.882 --> 00:10:28.715
- Godspeed.

00:10:28.715 --> 00:10:29.548
- Thank you, Whitney!

00:10:29.548 --> 00:10:30.381
- Good luck!

00:10:30.381 --> 00:10:31.214
- [Kelly] Thank you for that PSA!

00:10:31.214 --> 00:10:34.400
The best part was like, two years?

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.171
Wear a helmet, 'cause she
gonna beat you beat you--

00:10:36.171 --> 00:10:38.017
- When guys after two years are like,

00:10:38.017 --> 00:10:39.570
"Here's a necklace," outta here.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.496
- [Kelly] Outta here!

00:10:40.496 --> 00:10:41.329
- Outta here.

00:10:41.329 --> 00:10:42.162
- [Kelly] You take that
jewelry and shove it!

00:10:42.162 --> 00:10:42.995
(laughs)

00:10:42.995 --> 00:10:44.440
Bless your heart!
- Bless your heart!

